{
  "title": "Unique Snappy Slovakian Rigatoni Pasta",
  "description": "A malty and snappy Slovakian dish featuring rigatoni, perfect for a date night, made with a soffritto base and ayurvedic sattvic friendly ingredients, cooked in a wok.",
  "cuisine": "Slovakian",
